{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/compare/main...eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56","html_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/compare/main...eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56","permalink_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/compare/WebKit:55d1b9d...WebKit:eba64ef","diff_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/compare/main...eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/compare/main...eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"55d1b9d196308717e02235a8b4c447ec2b328be8","node_id":"C_kwDOExyGPdoAKDU1ZDFiOWQxOTYzMDg3MTdlMDIyMzVhOGI0YzQ0N2VjMmIzMjhiZTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexey Proskuryakov","email":"ap@apple.com","date":"2026-11-21T23:42:21Z"},"committer":{"name":"Alexey Proskuryakov","email":"ap@webkit.org","date":"2026-11-21T23:42:21Z"},"message":"[WebDriver] imported/w3c/webdriver/tests/classic/perform_actions/wheel_events.py::test_scroll_on_not_scrollable_element is a flaky failure\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=332599\n\nReviewed by BJ Burg.\n\nOn Mac, the UI process scrolling tree only sends a wheel event to the web process when the event region at its\nlocation has a wheel event listener. Event regions arrive with layer tree commits, so a simulated wheel event sent\nright after a listener was added, as on the first page load in a fresh browser, never reached the listener. The\naction still completed successfully, and the test found no events.\n\nWait for a presentation update before dispatching a simulated wheel event, if the view is visible. Presentation\nupdates can be postponed for a hidden or occluded view (webkit.org/b/329452), so those still dispatch without\nwaiting, as before.\n\nTest: imported/w3c/webdriver/tests/classic/perform_actions/wheel_new_listener.py\n\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/Automation/WebAutomationSession.cpp:\n(WebKit::WebAutomationSession::simulateWheelInteraction): Wait for the next presentation update on Mac.\n(WebKit::WebAutomationSession::dispatchWheelInteraction): Moved from simulateWheelInteraction().\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/Automation/WebAutomationSession.h:\n* WebDriverTests/TestExpectations.json: The new test is expected to fail on WPE, like the other new wheel tests.\n* WebDriverTests/imported/w3c/webdriver/tests/classic/perform_actions/wheel_new_listener.py: Added. Dispatches a\nwheel action while the main thread is busy right after adding a listener, so that no rendering update can happen\nin between.\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/327542@main","tree":{"sha":"ce0c288c4d951abb0e6dd6c5600ed77eaaf7da94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/git/trees/ce0c288c4d951abb0e6dd6c5600ed77eaaf7da94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/git/commits/55d1b9d196308717e02235a8b4c447ec2b328be8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/commits/55d1b9d196308717e02235a8b4c447ec2b328be8","html_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/55d1b9d196308717e02235a8b4c447ec2b328be8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/commits/55d1b9d196308717e02235a8b4c447ec2b328be8/comments","author":{"login":"aproskuryakov","id":5872842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzI4NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5872842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov","html_url":"https://github.com/aproskuryakov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"aproskuryakov","id":5872842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzI4NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5872842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov","html_url":"https://github.com/aproskuryakov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aproskuryakov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2058aee8d8de51f99bcfae24de4e788ba290aeec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/commits/2058aee8d8de51f99bcfae24de4e788ba290aeec","html_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/2058aee8d8de51f99bcfae24de4e788ba290aeec"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56","node_id":"C_kwDOExyGPdoAKGViYTY0ZWY0NGRlMzk1MDkxZDY2YmRmZGYxYzJiMWYwZjQ5ODNjNTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Shu-yu Guo","email":"syg@apple.com","date":"2026-05-30T04:37:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"Jonathan Bedard","email":"jbedard@apple.com","date":"2026-05-30T04:37:19Z"},"message":"[JSC] Array rematerialization should know how to have a bad time\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=311883\nrdar://174420676\n\nReviewed by Keith Miller.\n\nSunk Arrays that are rematerialized with a butterfly are always rematerialized\nwith a contiguous butterfly. If, in the meantime, the VM had a bad time and\nmoved all Array structures to SlowPutArrayStorage, rematerialization can end up\ntreating remterialized Arrays, which are now ArrayStorage, as if they had\ncontiguous butterflies.\n\nThis PR fixes that by always rematerializing with the contiguous butterfly, but\nswitching to SlowPutArrayStorage after the fact if the VM is having a bad time.\n\nTest: JSTests/stress/ftl-osr-exit-phantom-new-array-with-butterfly-having-a-bad-time.js\n\n* JSTests/stress/ftl-osr-exit-phantom-new-array-with-butterfly-having-a-bad-time.js: Added.\n(cb):\n(collect):\n(opt):\n* Source/JavaScriptCore/ftl/FTLOperations.cpp:\n(JSC::FTL::JSC_DEFINE_NOEXCEPT_JIT_OPERATION):\n\nOriginally-landed-as: 305413.641@rapid/safari-7624.2.5.110-branch (899331a21899). rdar://176058667\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/314202@main","tree":{"sha":"401f80219e1498fc409f2e70e3e4438114d61489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/git/trees/401f80219e1498fc409f2e70e3e4438114d61489"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/git/commits/eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/commits/eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56","html_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/commits/eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56/comments","author":{"login":"syg","id":95697,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Njk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95697?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syg","html_url":"https://github.com/syg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syg/follo